  (descr "Masach MS593-10F, 59.3x20.6mm SMD shield frame; modified metal: 2x1mm mouse holes centered on both short walls; land pattern 59.0x20.3mm. Manufacturer must notch metal. All six ground pads use pad 1. Four narrow separate F.CrtYd loops follow the frame walls, leaving the interior open.")
